1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,825
W: I was just informed we'll be getting a new assignment.

2
00:00:03,905 --> 00:00:06,885
We're scheduled to go to 83 Lambert Street.

3
00:00:07,845 --> 00:00:09,395
M1: What kind of work will we be doing there?

4
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:13,545
W: We've got to take care of the lawn and plant some trees and flowers.

5
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:16,165
The job starts tomorrow.

6
00:00:16,755 --> 00:00:19,225
M1: Okay, but I heard it's supposed to rain then.

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,050
Mr. Myers, can we delay the work next week if it rains?

8
00:00:23,845 --> 00:00:28,710
M2: In that case, you'll have the day off, but you'll need to come on the weekend to handle the job.

9
00:00:29,145 --> 00:00:31,525
It's for a new client, and we don't want to lose him.

10
00:00:33,125 --> 00:00:34,345
Is that okay, Tim?

11
00:00:34,745 --> 00:00:35,965
M1: I sure hope it doesn't rain.

12
00:00:36,225 --> 00:00:37,645
I'm planning to visit my parents.
